msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Language: zh_TW\n"

msgid "South Shore"
msgstr "南岸雪原"

msgid "Sea Gate"
msgstr "海閘碼頭"

msgid "Suppressor"
msgstr "消音器"

msgid "Threads onto the pistol. Use it to fit or remove. A fitted pistol is far quieter - only things close by will hear it."
msgstr "鎖在手槍槍口上。使用＝裝上或拆下。裝了之後槍聲小很多，只有附近的東西聽得到。"

msgid "Suppressor fitted. The pistol is quiet now."
msgstr "裝上消音器。手槍現在很安靜。"

msgid "Suppressor removed."
msgstr "拆下消音器。"

msgid "[%s] Silent takedown   [%s] Grab"
msgstr "[%s] 背後一擊   [%s] 擒拿"

msgid "Station 1F"
msgstr "北緯站 一樓"

msgid "Clean Room (Safe)"
msgstr "無菌室（安全屋）"

msgid "Station 2F"
msgstr "北緯站 二樓"

msgid "Director's Office"
msgstr "站長室"

msgid "Fuel Depot"
msgstr "燃料庫"

msgid "Station B1"
msgstr "北緯站 地下一樓"

msgid "Hangar"
msgstr "機庫"

msgid "Antenna Tower - Yard"
msgstr "天線塔・庭院"

msgid "Antenna Tower - Comms Deck"
msgstr "天線塔・通訊甲板"

msgid "Drill Shaft"
msgstr "鑽探井"

msgid "Shaft Bottom"
msgstr "井底"

msgid "Weather Huts"
msgstr "氣象小屋群"

msgid "Bunk Hut (Safe)"
msgstr "床鋪小屋（安全屋）"

msgid "TUNDRA MOTHER"
msgstr "苔原之母"

msgid "THE DEEP WELL"
msgstr "深井"

msgid "dish de-icer"
msgstr "天線碟除冰器"

msgid "drill heaters"
msgstr "鑽頭加熱器"

msgid "TAPE (Mendez): \"...the clicking started on day four. They follow the sound of our boots. If anything happens, I'll keep a loop running on 124.35.\""
msgstr "錄音帶（曼德茲）：「……喀喀聲從第四天開始。牠們循著我們的腳步聲走。萬一我出事，我會在 124.35 一直重播。」"

msgid "WHITEBOARD: \"OPS LOG / drop schedule -> 127.80 (automated). Don't use the ops channel for chatter! - H.\""
msgstr "白板：「作業日誌／空投時程 → 127.80（自動）。不准在作業頻道聊天！——H」"

msgid "DESK NOTE (Halvorsen): \"Ark line, 125.70, scheduled windows only. They promised a pickup for the samples. Not for us.\""
msgstr "桌上的便條（哈爾沃森）：「方舟專線，125.70，只在排定的時段。他們答應來接樣本。不是來接我們。」"

msgid "HALVORSEN'S RECORDS: \"Day 3: Mendez and Lund show the clicking. Kept off the report - the Ark people paid for this season. Day 6: moved the infected to cold storage. Day 9: power cut. God help us.\""
msgstr "哈爾沃森的紀錄：「第 3 天：曼德茲和倫德開始出現喀喀聲。沒寫進報告——這一季的經費是方舟出的。第 6 天：把感染者移到冷藏庫。第 9 天：停電。願上帝幫助我們。」"

msgid "MANIFEST: \"Drum 7 - diesel, generator grade. Moved to the back of the warehouse after the storm. The thing in here hunts by sound. Walk soft.\""
msgstr "貨單：「7 號桶——發電機用柴油。暴風雪之後移到倉庫最裡面。這裡面那東西靠聲音獵食。腳步放輕。」"

msgid "Relay shed log: \"Dish iced over again. The de-icer breaker is out on the dish platform - and don't run it with the comms deck unguarded, Halvorsen says the noise carries.\""
msgstr "中繼小屋日誌：「天線碟又結冰了。除冰器的配電箱在天線碟平台上——通訊甲板沒人顧的時候別開，哈爾沃森說那聲音傳得很遠。」"

msgid "Uplink log, last entry: \"Outbound blocked by order of the director. Inbound only. Something keeps answering on 126.05 - not our people.\""
msgstr "上行日誌，最後一筆：「站長下令封鎖對外發訊，只能接收。有東西一直在 126.05 回應——不是我們的人。」"

msgid "MET LOG, day 12: \"Wind ninety knots. Anyone caught between huts won't make it. The ridge beacon still has kerosene - the supply drone homes on it.\""
msgstr "氣象日誌，第 12 天：「風速九十節。在小屋之間被困住的人撐不過去。稜線上的信標還有煤油——補給無人機會循著它飛來。」"

msgid "PIETER (scrawled): \"Kept the bunk hut warm for whoever makes it. Radio's on the shelf. Light the beacon on the ridge - the drone drops by the south fence. Too cold to walk back. Sorry.\""
msgstr "彼得（潦草的字跡）：「床鋪小屋我一直開著暖氣，留給撐得到的人。無線電在架子上。點燃稜線上的信標——無人機會把東西投在南邊的圍欄旁。太冷了，走不回去了。抱歉。」"

msgid "Get inside the station"
msgstr "進入研究站"

msgid "Nobody met the launch. Go up from the sea gate and find a way into the research station."
msgstr "沒有人來接船。從海閘碼頭往上走，找路進入研究站。"

msgid "Find somewhere safe"
msgstr "找到安全的地方"

msgid "There has to be a sealed room somewhere off the corridors. Find it and get on the radio."
msgstr "走廊旁邊一定有密封的房間。找到它，用無線電聯絡。"

msgid "Reach the upper floor"
msgstr "到達樓上"

msgid "Kovac wants the director's records. His office is on the upper floor - the stairs are off the main hall."
msgstr "柯瓦奇要站長的紀錄。站長室在樓上——樓梯在大廳旁邊。"

msgid "Halvorsen's records"
msgstr "哈爾沃森的紀錄"

msgid "The director's office is at the east end of the upper floor. The door needs a keycard - someone in the dorms had one."
msgstr "站長室在二樓東側盡頭。門要權限卡——宿舍裡有人帶著一張。"

msgid "Restore power"
msgstr "恢復電力"

msgid "The B1 generator ran dry. There's diesel at the fuel depot east of the shore. Your level 2 card opens the basement door in the lab."
msgstr "地下一樓的發電機沒油了。南岸東邊的燃料庫有柴油。等級 2 的權限卡可以打開實驗室裡往地下層的門。"

msgid "The hangar"
msgstr "機庫"

msgid "With power back, the hangar door north of the shore will open. The snowcat inside can reach the antenna. Something big was locked in there."
msgstr "恢復電力後，南岸北邊的機庫門就打得開。裡面的雪地車可以開到天線塔。有個很大的東西被關在裡面。"

msgid "The antenna"
msgstr "天線塔"

msgid "Climb to the comms deck at the top of the antenna tower and get a message off the island. What you ask for is up to you."
msgstr "爬上天線塔頂的通訊甲板，把訊息發出這座島。要請求什麼，由你決定。"

msgid "The drill shaft"
msgstr "鑽探井"

msgid "Whatever answered on 126.05 is coming. It all started in the drill shaft under B1 - your card now opens the door at the south end of the basement. End it at the bottom, then take the lift up."
msgstr "在 126.05 回應的那些人要來了。一切都是從地下一樓底下的鑽探井開始的——你的權限卡現在打得開地下層南端的門。到井底結束這一切，再搭升降機上來。"

msgid "KOVAC: \"Going to the depot? Find the manifest first. Mendez said something nests in that warehouse.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「要去燃料庫？先找到貨單。曼德茲說那間倉庫裡有東西在築巢。」"

msgid "Depot manifest"
msgstr "燃料庫的貨單"

msgid "Read the manifest in the depot warehouse before you go for the fuel."
msgstr "去拿燃料之前，先讀燃料庫倉庫裡的貨單。"

msgid "KOVAC: \"West of the shore there's the old weather camp. Pieter Lund kept the bunk hut heated - if anyone's alive out there, it's him. Dress for it: the wind out there kills.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「南岸西邊是舊的氣象營地。彼得．倫德一直讓床鋪小屋開著暖氣——外面要是還有人活著，就是他。穿暖一點：那裡的風會要人命。」"

msgid "The weather camp"
msgstr "氣象營地"

msgid "Cross the snowfield west of the shore. Find the warm bunk hut and find out what happened to Pieter Lund."
msgstr "穿過南岸西邊的雪原。找到溫暖的床鋪小屋，查出彼得．倫德出了什麼事。"

msgid "Beacon on the ridge"
msgstr "稜線上的信標"

msgid "Pieter's note: light the beacon drum on the north ridge of the weather camp. The supply drone will drop by the south fence."
msgstr "彼得的紙條：點燃氣象營地北邊稜線上的信標油桶。補給無人機會把東西投在南邊的圍欄旁。"

msgid "Supply drop"
msgstr "空投補給"

msgid "One of the supply crates is still sitting on the dock where you unloaded it."
msgstr "有一個補給箱還放在碼頭上，就在你卸貨的地方。"

msgid "KOVAC: \"Mendez kept a recorder in the lab. If it's still there, it'll tell you how they hunt.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「曼德茲在實驗室放了一台錄音機。如果還在，它會告訴你牠們怎麼獵食。」"

msgid "The researcher's tape"
msgstr "研究員的錄音帶"

msgid "Mendez's recorder should still be in the lab. It may reveal the patrol patterns."
msgstr "曼德茲的錄音機應該還在實驗室。也許能知道牠們的巡邏路線。"

msgid "KOVAC: \"They go sluggish in the cold. The lab breaker controls the lounge heating. Use it.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「牠們在冷的地方會變遲鈍。實驗室的配電箱控制交誼廳的暖氣。好好利用。」"

msgid "Cut the heat"
msgstr "關掉暖氣"

msgid "The infected slow down in the cold. Shut off the lounge heating from the lab breaker."
msgstr "感染者在冷的地方會變慢。用實驗室的配電箱關掉交誼廳的暖氣。"

msgid "ENDING: QUARANTINE"
msgstr "結局：隔離"

msgid "The lift groans up through the dark. By the time you reach the hangar, the sky over Greycrow is full of engines."
msgstr "升降機在黑暗中嘎吱上升。等你走到機庫，灰鴉島的天空已經滿是引擎聲。"

msgid "Nobody lands. Nobody leaves. Three days later the station burns from the air - exactly as you asked."
msgstr "沒有人降落，也沒有人離開。三天後，研究站在空襲中燃燒——正如你所要求的。"

msgid "On the fourth day a helicopter with no markings sets down on the south shore. The pilot says your name before you do."
msgstr "第四天，一架沒有任何標誌的直升機降落在南岸。你還沒開口，駕駛就先叫出了你的名字。"

msgid "You never learn who sent it. Somewhere under your skin, the cold goes quiet and waits."
msgstr "你始終不知道是誰派它來的。在你皮膚底下的某處，那股寒意安靜下來，等待著。"

msgid "ENDING: EVACUATION"
msgstr "結局：撤離"

msgid "The rescue flight comes on the third morning. Blankets, hot tea, a medic who won't stop talking."
msgstr "第三天早上，救援班機來了。毯子、熱茶、一個講個不停的醫護兵。"

msgid "They take the survivors, the logs, the sealed sample cases. Nobody opens the sample cases."
msgstr "他們帶走了倖存者、紀錄，還有密封的樣本箱。沒有人打開那些樣本箱。"

msgid "Somewhere over the sea, behind the cargo net, something begins to click."
msgstr "在海面上空的某處，貨網後面，有什麼東西開始喀喀作響。"

msgid "ENDING: THE LAST LIGHT"
msgstr "結局：最後的光"

msgid "You know before the lift stops: there is nobody coming that you could let near this island."
msgstr "升降機還沒停下，你就知道了：不管誰要來，都不能讓他們靠近這座島。"

msgid "You open every valve on the fuel line and walk back down into the station."
msgstr "你打開燃料管線上的每一個閥門，轉身走回研究站。"

msgid "From the sea, the rescue crew will report a single bright light on Greycrow. Then nothing."
msgstr "海上的救援隊後來回報：灰鴉島上亮起一道強光。然後，什麼都沒有了。"

msgid "You know before the lift stops: the cold in your blood isn't the weather anymore."
msgstr "升降機還沒停下，你就知道了：血裡的寒意，已經不是天氣造成的。"

msgid "Distress"
msgstr "國際求救頻率"

msgid "[121.50] ...DISTRESS BEACON. LAUNCH KITTIWAKE THREE. POSITION GREYCROW ISLAND, SEA GATE..."
msgstr "[121.50] ……求救信標。補給艇「三趾鷗三號」。位置：灰鴉島，海閘碼頭……"

msgid "That's your own beacon. Under it, fainter: a second one. B-6204 - the supply flight that vanished nine days ago."
msgstr "那是你自己的信標。底下還有一個更微弱的：B-6204——九天前失蹤的那班補給機。"

msgid "Mendez"
msgstr "曼德茲"

msgid "MENDEZ (looped): \"Day nine. If someone hears this - security's shotgun is not in the armory.\""
msgstr "曼德茲（重複播放）：「第九天。如果有人聽到——保全的散彈槍不在軍械室。」"

msgid "\"I hid it under the floor grate at the far east end of the south corridor. Two shells in it, a few more beside it.\""
msgstr "「我把它藏在南走廊最東邊的地板格柵底下。裡面有兩發，旁邊還有幾發。」"

msgid "\"Don't let Halvorsen find it. He'd rather keep them alive than keep us alive.\""
msgstr "「別讓哈爾沃森找到。他寧可讓牠們活著，也不管我們的死活。」"

msgid "Ops log"
msgstr "作業日誌"

msgid "[127.80] GREYCROW OPS - AUTOMATED LOG. SUPPLY DROP 11 CACHED, EAST SHORE ROCKS BELOW THE STATION WALL."
msgstr "[127.80] 灰鴉作業——自動日誌。第 11 次空投已存放於研究站外牆下方的東岸岩石區。"

msgid "CONTENTS: 9MM AMMUNITION. LOG ENDS."
msgstr "內容物：9 毫米子彈。日誌結束。"

msgid "Ark line"
msgstr "方舟專線"

msgid "[125.70] ...ARK RELAY. WINDOW OPEN. Greycrow, report sample count."
msgstr "[125.70] ……方舟中繼。通訊窗口開啟。灰鴉，回報樣本數量。"

msgid "\"Greycrow, we read your silence as consent. Collection team will proceed. Survivors are not part of the manifest.\""
msgstr "「灰鴉，我們把你們的沉默視為同意。回收小組將照計畫進行。倖存者不在清單上。」"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "不明"

msgid "[126.05] ...hold position. Do not transmit. Retrieval is inbound."
msgstr "[126.05] ……原地待命。不要發訊。回收隊正在路上。"

msgid "\"Sample integrity is priority one. Survivors are... secondary.\""
msgstr "「樣本完整是第一優先。倖存者……其次。」"

msgid "Empty bottle"
msgstr "空瓶"

msgid "Throw it to make noise somewhere else. Loud glass."
msgstr "丟出去在別的地方製造聲音。玻璃碎裂聲很大。"

msgid "Stone"
msgstr "石頭"

msgid "Clacks off the ice. Quieter than glass - good for a nudge."
msgstr "打在冰上喀一聲。比玻璃安靜——適合輕輕引開一隻。"

msgid "Firebomb"
msgstr "汽油彈"

msgid "Bottle, ethanol, a strip of your sleeve. Your lighter does the rest. Burns anything standing in it."
msgstr "瓶子、酒精、一條從袖子撕下來的布。剩下的交給打火機。站在火裡的都會被燒。"

msgid "Heat pack"
msgstr "暖暖包"

msgid "Crack it and stuff it in your jacket. Buys you time in the cold."
msgstr "折一下塞進外套。能在寒冷中多撐一會兒。"

msgid "Lab ethanol"
msgstr "實驗室酒精"

msgid "Use it with an empty bottle to make a firebomb."
msgstr "和空瓶組合可以做成汽油彈。"

msgid "Pistol rounds"
msgstr "手槍子彈"

msgid "9mm. Never enough."
msgstr "9 毫米。永遠不夠用。"

msgid "First aid kit"
msgstr "急救包"

msgid "Stops the bleeding. Restores health."
msgstr "止血。恢復生命值。"

msgid "Antibacterial shot"
msgstr "抗菌藥劑"

msgid "Experimental. Pushes the infection back."
msgstr "實驗性藥物。能壓下感染。"

msgid "Pistol"
msgstr "手槍"

msgid "Station security sidearm. 8-round magazine."
msgstr "研究站保全的配槍。彈匣 8 發。"

msgid "Shotgun"
msgstr "散彈槍"

msgid "Pump shotgun. Devastating up close, useless at range. 2-shell tube."
msgstr "泵動式散彈槍。近距離威力驚人，遠了就沒用。彈倉 2 發。"

msgid "Shotgun shells"
msgstr "散彈"

msgid "12 gauge. Count every one."
msgstr "12 號口徑。每一發都要算好。"

msgid "GREYCROW UPLINK  -  CARRIER LOCKED"
msgstr "灰鴉上行站　－　載波鎖定"

msgid "The tower battery is almost gone. One transmission, then nothing."
msgstr "天線塔的電池快沒電了。只能發一次，之後就什麼都沒有。"

msgid "Whatever you send decides who comes to this island - and who leaves it."
msgstr "你發出的內容，將決定誰會來到這座島——以及誰能離開。"

msgid "EVACUATE - send aircraft, get the survivors off the island"
msgstr "撤離——派飛機來，把倖存者帶離這座島"

msgid "[OUT] GREYCROW TO ANY STATION. SURVIVORS AT NORTH LATITUDE STATION. REQUEST IMMEDIATE EVACUATION."
msgstr "[發送] 灰鴉呼叫任何電台。北緯站有倖存者。請求立即撤離。"

msgid "[IN] RESCUE CENTRE: Copy, Greycrow. Evacuation flight tasked, weather permitting. Seventy-two hours. Hang on."
msgstr "[接收] 救援中心：收到，灰鴉。撤離班機已排定，視天候而定。七十二小時。撐住。"

msgid "QUARANTINE - seal Greycrow, nobody leaves, nothing lands"
msgstr "隔離——封鎖灰鴉島，沒有人離開，什麼都不准降落"

msgid "[OUT] GREYCROW TO ANY STATION. BIOLOGICAL CONTAMINATION. QUARANTINE THE ISLAND. DO NOT LAND. NOBODY LEAVES."
msgstr "[發送] 灰鴉呼叫任何電台。生物汙染。隔離這座島。不要降落。任何人都不准離開。"

msgid "[IN] RESCUE CENTRE: ...Say again, Greycrow? Copy quarantine. Passing it up the chain. Stay off the air."
msgstr "[接收] 救援中心：……灰鴉，請再說一次？收到隔離要求。會往上呈報。保持無線電靜默。"

msgid "DESTROY - the station must burn, with everything in it"
msgstr "摧毀——研究站必須燒掉，連同裡面的一切"

msgid "[OUT] GREYCROW TO ANY STATION. THE STATION IS LOST. DESTROY IT. DO NOT SEND PEOPLE."
msgstr "[發送] 灰鴉呼叫任何電台。研究站已經失守。摧毀它。不要派人來。"

msgid "[IN] RESCUE CENTRE: Greycrow, we can't act on that. Who is transmitting? Identify yourself."
msgstr "[接收] 救援中心：灰鴉，我們無法照辦。發訊的是誰？表明你的身分。"

msgid "[IN 126.05] Hold position. Do not transmit again. We will come to you."
msgstr "[接收 126.05] 原地等待。不要再發訊。我們會去接你。"

msgid "That wasn't the rescue centre. The carrier dies. Below the station, the drill shaft is humming."
msgstr "那不是救援中心。載波斷了。研究站底下，鑽探井正在嗡嗡作響。"

msgid "  (STUNNED)"
msgstr "　（暈眩）"

msgid "  (RESONATING)"
msgstr "　（共鳴中）"

msgid "  (CORE EXPOSED)"
msgstr "　（核心露出）"

msgid "Take keycard (Level %d)"
msgstr "拿起權限卡（等級 %d）"

msgid "Take bottle"
msgstr "撿起空瓶"

msgid "Kick %s (loud)  - or knife it quietly"
msgstr "%s（很大聲）——或用小刀安靜地割開"

msgid "it open"
msgstr "踢開"

msgid "the boards down"
msgstr "踢倒木板"

msgid "Heat OFF (%s)"
msgstr "關掉暖氣（%s）"

msgid "Heat ON (%s)"
msgstr "打開暖氣（%s）"

msgid "Go upstairs"
msgstr "上樓"

msgid "Go downstairs"
msgstr "下樓"

msgid "Take the fire extinguisher (both hands)"
msgstr "拿起滅火器（雙手）"

msgid "Carry fuel can (both hands)"
msgstr "搬起燃料桶（雙手）"

msgid "Generator (running)"
msgstr "發電機（運轉中）"

msgid "Refuel and start generator"
msgstr "加油並啟動發電機"

msgid "Generator (no fuel)"
msgstr "發電機（沒有燃料）"

msgid "No room (%s)"
msgstr "放不下（%s）"

msgid "Take %s"
msgstr "撿起%s"

msgid "Take %s x%d"
msgstr "撿起%s x%d"

msgid "Light the drum (lighter)"
msgstr "點燃油桶（打火機）"

msgid "Radio (save)"
msgstr "無線電（存檔）"

msgid "Frequency %s noted in the radio memo."
msgstr "頻率 %s 已記進無線電備忘錄。"

msgid "Ride the lift up"
msgstr "搭升降機上去"

msgid "Lift (jammed)"
msgstr "升降機（卡住了）"

msgid "The lift cage is wrapped in crystal. It won't move while that thing is still singing."
msgstr "升降機的籠子被結晶包住了。那東西還在鳴唱，它就動不了。"

msgid "Snowcat (not safe yet)"
msgstr "雪地車（還不安全）"

msgid "Drive to %s"
msgstr "開往%s"

msgid "Pick up stones"
msgstr "撿石頭"

