msgstr "上行終端機（沒有訊號）"

msgid "The uplink is silent. Whatever comes now, you already called it."
msgstr "上行終端機一片沉默。接下來來的不管是什麼，都是你叫來的。"

msgid "NO CARRIER. The dish outside is iced over - the de-icer must be off."
msgstr "沒有載波。外面的天線碟結冰了——除冰器一定沒開。"

