msgstr "關閉"

msgid "KOVAC: \"Shen. I left Greycrow on the last flight out, two weeks ago - day three. I'm the one who named this thing. Find the director's records upstairs. I need to know what he did after I left.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「沈若寧。我兩個星期前搭最後一班飛機離開灰鴉島——事件第三天。這東西的名字是我取的。去樓上找站長的紀錄。我要知道我走了之後他做了什麼。」"

