msgstr "這是電動門。沒有電。"

msgid "Locked. Keycard access level %d required."
msgstr "鎖著。需要權限卡等級 %d。"

msgid "The generator roars to life. Lights flicker on across the station - and the heating with them."
msgstr "發電機轟然啟動。整座研究站的燈閃爍著亮起——暖氣也跟著恢復了。"

